{
  "name": "33 · Monitor de salud de APIs",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 33 · Salud de APIs\n\n1. Edita la lista de endpoints en el nodo \"Definir endpoints\".\n2. Bot de Telegram: créalo gratis con @BotFather, pega el token en la credencial y tu chat_id en el nodo de alerta.\n3. Hoja de Google Sheets con pestaña \"Incidencias\".\n\nCada 5 minutos hace ping y solo alerta cuando algo responde 4xx/5xx o no responde.",
        "width": 460,
        "height": 260
      },
      "id": "nodo_129",
      "name": "Nota de configuración",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "minutes",
              "minutesInterval": 5
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "nodo_130",
      "name": "Cada 5 minutos",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Lista de servicios a vigilar: añade o quita los tuyos.\nconst endpoints = [\n  { nombre: 'API principal', url: 'https://api.ejemplo.com/health' },\n  { nombre: 'Web pública', url: 'https://www.ejemplo.com' },\n  { nombre: 'Panel de alumnos', url: 'https://panel.ejemplo.com/status' }\n];\nreturn endpoints.map(function (e) {\n  return { json: e };\n});"
      },
      "id": "nodo_131",
      "name": "Definir endpoints",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        220,
        340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $json.url }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 10000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true,
              "fullResponse": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "nodo_132",
      "name": "Hacer ping",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        440,
        340
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "notes": "Transport errors continue as an error item and must be evaluated downstream."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem",
        "jsCode": "const objetivo = $('Definir endpoints').item.json;\nconst codigo = Number($json.statusCode || 0);\nconst caido = codigo === 0 || codigo >= 400;\nreturn {\n  json: {\n    nombre: objetivo.nombre,\n    url: objetivo.url,\n    codigo_http: codigo,\n    caido: caido,\n    comprobado_en: new Date().toISOString()\n  }\n};"
      },
      "id": "nodo_133",
      "name": "Evaluar respuesta",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        660,
        340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond_017",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.caido }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "nodo_134",
      "name": "¿Servicio caído?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        880,
        340
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "REEMPLAZAR_ID_DOCUMENTO"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "Incidencias"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": []
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "nodo_135",
      "name": "Registrar incidencia",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        1100,
        240
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleSheetsOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "REEMPLAZAR",
          "name": "Google Sheets (OAuth2)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "REEMPLAZAR_CHAT_ID",
        "text": "=[CAÍDA] {{ $json.nombre }}\n\nURL: {{ $json.url }}\nCódigo HTTP: {{ $json.codigo_http }}\nHora: {{ $json.comprobado_en }}\n\n(0 = sin respuesta / timeout)",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "nodo_136",
      "name": "Alerta por Telegram",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1320,
        240
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "REEMPLAZAR",
          "name": "Telegram Bot"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {},
      "id": "nodo_137",
      "name": "Servicio OK",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1100,
        460
      ]
    }
  ],
